# Build-context ALLOWLIST: exclude everything, then re-include only what
# deploy/Dockerfile copies. Without this, `docker build .` would upload the
# multi-GB venv/ and data/ directories to the Docker daemon on every build.
*
!api/
!api/**
!src/retrieval/
!src/retrieval/**
!scripts/fetch_artifacts.py
!deploy/requirements/api.txt

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
